diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8c2c1fa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.version.Version.compare` is deprecated
+and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use ``Version(**other)`` instead.
+Strings, tuples, lists and :class:`~semver.version.Version` objects are
+unaffected.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0a5dba2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version`
+is renamed to ``token``, consistent with ``bump_prerelease`` and ``bump_build``.
+``prerelease_token=`` still works but is deprecated and emits a
+:class:`DeprecationWarning`.
